          "requested_change": "Change only generated_support_boundary_delegation_count 20->21 and raw_port_connection_count 53->43 in the resolved frontmatter, SEL-SUPPORT-01, SUPPORT-01, and PASS-01. Preserve PART-01..PART-13, INT-01..INT-33, the 13/33/29/10 semantic point, all policies/cases/scenarios, boundary behavior, and claim exclusions."
        },
        {
          "classification": "no-concern",
